{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium comparison section for the Folliq hair care brand.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Follow the official Folliq Brand Guidelines exactly.
    
    The section must NOT make medical claims.
    
    Instead, compare daily hair care solutions and highlight the advantages of Folliq in a premium, trustworthy way.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    Brand Style
    
    • Premium
    
    • Luxury
    
    • Botanical
    
    • Scandinavian
    
    • Clinical
    
    • Minimal
    
    Inspired by
    
    Apple
    
    Rhode
    
    Aesop
    
    Act+Acre
    
    Vegamour
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    COLOR PALETTE
    
    Primary Green
    
    #33452D
    
    Dark Green
    
    #273522
    
    Accent Green
    
    #56694B
    
    Warm Ivory
    
    #F2EEE3
    
    Soft Ivory
    
    #FAF8F3
    
    Text
    
    #1F231D
    
    Border
    
    rgba(255,255,255,.12)
    
    White
    
    #FFFFFF
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    BACKGROUND
    
    Background
    
    #273522
    
    Add a premium botanical organic texture with 5% opacity.
    
    Maximum Width
    
    1480px
    
    Padding
    
    120px Top
    
    120px Bottom
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    SECTION HEADER
    
    Small Label
    
    WHY CHOOSE FOLLIQ
    
    Heading
    
    Why Folliq Stands Apart
    
    Description
    
    See how Folliq compares with traditional hair care products and why thousands of customers choose it as part of their daily routine.
    
    Center aligned.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    COMPARISON TABLE
    
    Create a premium comparison table.
    
    Desktop
    
    5 Columns
    
    Column 1
    
    Feature Labels
    
    Column 2
    
    Folliq
    
    Highlight this column.
    
    Columns 3–5
    
    Regular Shampoo
    
    Conditioner Only
    
    Generic Hair Products
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    FOLLIQ COLUMN
    
    White card
    
    Rounded Corners
    
    24px
    
    Soft Shadow
    
    Slightly larger than the other columns.
    
    Display uploaded product image above the column.
    
    IMPORTANT
    
    The product image MUST NOT be hardcoded.
    
    Use a Shopify Image Picker so the merchant can upload any product image from the Theme Editor.
    
    Include settings for:
    
    • Product Image Upload
    
    • Image Width
    
    • Image Position
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    FEATURES
    
    Supports healthier-looking hair
    
    ✓
    
    Daily scalp care
    
    ✓
    
    Botanical ingredients
    
    ✓
    
    Sulfate Free
    
    ✓
    
    Suitable for all hair types
    
    ✓
    
    Easy daily routine
    
    ✓
    
    Premium formulation
    
    ✓
    
    Trusted by thousands
    
    ✓
    
    Every row should contain either
    
    ✓
    
    or
    
    —
    
    using premium circular icons.
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    TABLE STYLE
    
    Rounded Cards
    
    24px
    
    Soft Borders
    
    Premium spacing
    
    Hover lift
    
    Folliq column slightly elevated
    
    Smooth animations
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Heading
    
    Cormorant Garamond
    
    56px
    
    Table Headings
    
    Cormorant Garamond
    
    28px
    
    Rows
    
    Manrope
    
    18px
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    BOTTOM CTA
    
    Centered.
    
    Heading
    
    Ready to Upgrade Your Hair Care Routine?
    
    Description
    
    Experience premium botanical care designed to support healthier-looking hair every day.
    
    Button
    
    Shop Folliq
    
    Background
    
    #56694B
    
    Hover
    
    #33452D
    
    Rounded
    
    16px
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    THEME EDITOR SETTINGS
    
    Everything must be editable.
    
    Section Label
    
    Heading
    
    Description
    
    Product Image Upload
    
    Product Image Width
    
    Column Titles
    
    Feature Names
    
    Checkmarks
    
    Icons
    
    CTA Heading
    
    CTA Description
    
    Button Text
    
    Button URL
    
    Spacing
    
    Colors
    
    Border Radius
    
    Typography
    
    --------------------------------------------------
    
    DESIGN GOAL
    
    The section should feel like a premium comparison used by luxury DTC beauty brands.
    
    Avoid exaggerated claims.
    
    Use generous whitespace, elegant typography and refined botanical styling.
    
    The entire section should reinforce trust, premium quality and modern hair care while remaining fully responsive and completely editable through the Shopify Theme Editor.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-folliq-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    background-image: {{ block.settings.background_texture }};
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.table_bottom_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.column_bg }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.column_padding }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.folliq_column_bg }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.column_padding }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.folliq_border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-12px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: {{ block.settings.product_image_width }}%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.column_heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.column_heading_color }};
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    min-height: 70px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.folliq_heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: contents;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.feature_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.feature_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding }}px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.row_border_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.row_padding }}px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.row_border_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.icon_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.check_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.check_color }};
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-icon-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.dash_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.dash_color }};
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    background: {{ block.settings.cta_bg }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.cta_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.cta_padding }}px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_description_color }};
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    background: {{ block.settings.button_bg }};
    padding: 16px 48px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.3s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-folliq-comparison-table-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      background: {{ block.settings.column_bg }};
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.border_radius }}px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.row_border_color }};
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      border-bottom: none;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-folliq-comparison-column-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-column-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
      transform: none;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.6 }}px;
    }

    .ai-folliq-comparison-cta-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.cta_heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-folliq-comparison-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.label != blank %}
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.label }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-folliq-comparison-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-table-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.product_image %}
          <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-product-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.product_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.product_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.product_image.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.product_image.height }}"
            >
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-folliq-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.folliq_title }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_2_title }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_3_title }}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-column-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.column_4_title }}</div>
      </div>

      {% for i in (1..8) %}
        {% liquid
          assign feature_key = 'feature_' | append: i
          assign folliq_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_folliq'
          assign col2_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_col2'
          assign col3_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_col3'
          assign col4_key = 'feature_' | append: i | append: '_col4'

          assign feature_name = block.settings[feature_key]
          assign folliq_value = block.settings[folliq_key]
          assign col2_value = block.settings[col2_key]
          assign col3_value = block.settings[col3_key]
          assign col4_value = block.settings[col4_key]
        %}

        {% if feature_name != blank %}
          <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-feature-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ feature_name }}</div>

            <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if folliq_value %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</div>
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}">—</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if col2_value %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</div>
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}">—</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if col3_value %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</div>
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}">—</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cell-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if col4_value %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-check-{{ ai_gen_id }}">✓</div>
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-folliq-comparison-icon-dash-{{ ai_gen_id }}">—</div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_cta %}
      <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.cta_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-folliq-comparison-cta-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cta_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.cta_description != blank %}
          <div class="ai-folliq-comparison-cta-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.cta_description }}</div>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_url }}" class="ai-folliq-comparison-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

